<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this macro minimizes recoil on arx and ar 33

the settings used
res : 1920x1080 16x9
sens : x=y 6
DPI : 800
scope magnification sens : (1x 40) (2.5x 50)

weapon attachments
arx : compensator magnified scope vertical grip
ar33 : muzzlebreak magnified vertical grip

this macro works perfectly on arx but on ar33 sometimes you can get a recoil pattern that will cause the macro to go a bit too mutch down but its light recoil going down so its pretty easy to counter</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 1 ms
LeftDown 1
MoveR -1 28
Delay 3 ms
Delay 6 ms
Delay 9 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>